---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import poster from '../../assets/home/founder.png';
import { getImage } from 'astro:assets';
const image = await getImage({ src: poster, width: 420, format: 'webp' });
---

<section class="founder wrap chapter" id="story">
  <div class="founder-art">
    <video
      id="namaste"
      muted
      loop
      playsinline
      preload="none"
      poster={image.src}
      width="210"
      height="270"
      aria-label="Chibi Saurabh bowing in namaste"
      ><source data-src="/home/founder.webm" type="video/webm" /></video
    >
  </div><div>
    <p class="eyebrow">A personal thank-you</p><h2>More than a<br />personal project.</h2><p>
      This started with my own typing bottleneck and a small project I wanted to use myself. It has
      now grown to thousands of downloads, and that means more to me than I expected.
    </p><p>
      Thank you to everyone who has tried EnviousWispr, reported a problem, suggested an improvement
      or shared it with a friend. Your feedback and continued support keep shaping the app.
    </p><p>
      I use it every day. I hope it gives you more room to think, create and get on with your day.
    </p><p class="signature">Saurabh <span>Founder, Envious Labs</span></p>
  </div>
</section>
